#| msgid "Logging for Qiskit Runtime {#logging-for-qiskit-runtime}"
msgid "Logging for IBM Quantum Compute Service {#logging-for-ibm-quantum-compute-service}"
msgstr "Logování pro Qiskit Runtime {#logging-for-qiskit-runtime}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "IBM Cloud&reg; services, such as Qiskit Runtime, generate platform logs that you can use to investigate abnormal activity and critical actions in your account, and troubleshoot problems.\n"
msgid "IBM Cloud&reg; services, such as IBM Quantum Compute Service, generate platform logs that you can use to investigate abnormal activity and critical actions in your account, and troubleshoot problems.\n"
msgstr "Služby IBM Cloud&reg;, jako je Qiskit Runtime, generují platformové logy, které můžeš použít k vyšetřování neobvyklé aktivity a kritických akcí ve svém účtu a k řešení problémů.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use [IBM Cloud Logs Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about), which is a platform service, to route platform logs in your account to a destination of your choice by configuring a tenant that defines where platform logs are sent. For more information, see [About Logs Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about).\n"
msgstr "Můžeš použít [IBM Cloud Logs Routing,](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about) což je platformová služba, k směrování platformových logů ve svém účtu do cíle dle vlastního výběru nastavením tenanta, který určuje, kam jsou platformové logy odesílány. Další informace najdeš v části [About Logs Routing.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use [IBM Cloud Logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs) to visualize and alert on platform logs that are generated in your account and routed by IBM Cloud Logs Routing to an IBM Cloud Logs instance.\n"
msgstr "Můžeš použít [IBM Cloud Logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs) k vizualizaci a upozornění na platformové logy generované ve svém účtu a směrované službou IBM Cloud Logs Routing do instance IBM Cloud Logs.\n"

