msgid "For information about fields included in every platform log, see [Fields that are included in platform logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about-platform-logs#about-platform-logs-2).\n"
msgstr "Informace o polích obsažených v každém platformovém logu najdeš v části [Fields that are included in platform logs.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about-platform-logs#about-platform-logs-2)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following fields are included in the log record.\n"
msgstr "Následující pole jsou zahrnuta v záznamu logu.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field           | Type     | Description                                                              |\n"
"|-----------------|----------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| logSourceCRN    | Required | Defines the account and flow log instance where the log is published.    |\n"
"| saveServiceCopy | Required | Defines whether IBM saves a copy of the record for operational purposes. |\n"
"| message         | Required | Description of the log that is generated.                                |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Pole            | Typ      | Popis                                                                           |\n"
"|-----------------|----------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| logSourceCRN    | Povinné  | Definuje účet a instanci flow logu, kde je log publikován.                      |\n"
"| saveServiceCopy | Povinné  | Definuje, zda IBM ukládá kopii záznamu pro provozní účely.                      |\n"
"| message         | Povinné  | Popis generovaného logu.                                                        |\n"
